<div id="entry-10" class="entry-asset asset">
    <div class="asset-header">
        <h2 class="asset-name"><a href="http://ranchocabron.com/harmfulerror/2008/10/del-vecchio-removed-from-bench.html">Del Vecchio Removed From Bench</a></h2>
        <div class="asset-meta">
    <span class="byline">

        By JoNell on October 21, 2008  3:57 PM

    </span>
    <span class="separator">|</span> <a class="permalink" href="http://ranchocabron.com/harmfulerror/2008/10/del-vecchio-removed-from-bench.html">Permalink</a>
    | <a href="http://ranchocabron.com/harmfulerror/2008/10/del-vecchio-removed-from-bench.html#comments">Comments (0)</a>
    | <a href="http://ranchocabron.com/harmfulerror/2008/10/del-vecchio-removed-from-bench.html#trackback">TrackBacks (0)</a>
</div>

    </div>
    <div class="asset-content">

        <div class="asset-body">
            The Las Vegas Review Journal reports that Family Court Judge Nicholas <a href="http://www.lvrj.com/news/breaking_news/31957834.html">DelVecchio was removed from office </a>today by the Nevada Commission on Judicial Discipline.&nbsp; He ntered a plea of no contest to 11 counts of violating judicial ethics rules.&nbsp; His term was to have expired at the end of the year.&nbsp; He was defeated for re-election in the primary.
        </div>



    </div>
    <div class="asset-footer"></div>
</div>

    
