    <div class="asset-content">

        <div class="asset-body">
            I'm having substantial problems with transferring the content of Harmful Error to the new server.&nbsp; With an opening brief in a capital case due on Tuesday and an oral argument at the law school on Friday, there's no way that I can devote time to solving this issue - so it looks like Harmful Error will be on a hiatus for a few days or a week or so.&nbsp; Please check back.<br /><br />NACJ will host a mixer with judicial candidates on Wednesday at the bar that is upstairs by Hennessey's and Micky Finn's.&nbsp; I think it's at 5 or 5:30.&nbsp; All criminal defense attorneys are invited to attend.<br /> 
        </div>



